{
  "slug": "remember",
  "name": "Remember",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Continuous memory for Claude Code. Extracts, summarizes, and compresses conversations into tiered daily logs. Claude remembers what you did yesterday.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, **1 command** and **4 hooks**.\n\n- **Skills** (1): `remember` (Save session state for clean continuation next session)\n- **Commands** (1): `doctor` (Diagnose the Remember plugin — resolved paths, detected tools, storage mode, and whether capture is actually saving memory)\n- **Hooks** (4): `SessionStart`, `UserPromptSubmit`, `PostToolUse`, `SessionEnd`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install remember@claude-plugins-official` from `Digital-Process-Tools/claude-remember`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
  "package": {
    "skill": 1,
    "hook": 4,
    "command": 1
  },
